  "ingredients": [
    "8 yellow summer squash, thinly sliced",
    "1 small yellow onion, thinly sliced",
    "1 egg, lightly beaten",
    "1 cup low-fat sour cream",
    "1 sleeve buttery round crackers (such as Ritz®), crushed, divided",
    "2 cups shredded sharp Cheddar cheese, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 1-quart casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/86nADKu6nKWyTOTsrX3YeIf-Do4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222320-mamas-summer-squash-casserole-VAT-step-01-9cbdb130380e45009d3a7a8a5d249428.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222320/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a steamer insert into a saucepan and fill with water to just below the bottom of the steamer. Bring water to a boil. Add squash and onion, cover, and steam until squash is tender and easily mashed with a fork, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HbhdYSls-ENe3JnmoZG-2YBfoV4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222320-mamas-summer-squash-casserole-VAT-step-02-100167d78d9b4d39bd1935b3d99eacdf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222320/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg and sour cream together in the prepared casserole dish; add squash, onions, 2/3 of the crackers, and 2/3 of the Cheddar cheese. Stir with a fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GlWbaTofY5NnO36UL7LMob7jHJw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222320-mamas-summer-squash-casserole-VAT-step-03-fdb7f7b33c724a46966c959e3686478f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222320/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the squash mixture with remaining Cheddar cheese and crackers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d_icpLSDjniPqiNcL831ZnpQ-RU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222320-mamas-summer-squash-casserole-VAT-step-04-b11cc9275ce34b4a925e2ac26d8ca8a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222320/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until hot and bubbly and topping is golden brown, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AdSIUVI5Tq97G_F9aUVJHRwLinc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222320-mamas-summer-squash-casserole-VAT-step-05-f674ab0d0a21429ea581f0cb0348c4ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222320/step_05.webp"
    }
